  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening governance of food security and nutrition through the CFS - HLPE-FSN Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome: More effective role of CFS in global food security and nutrition governance

Output 1.1. Production, translation, publication and launch of HLPE-FSN reports and notes on critical and emerging issues (CEI) on FSN, and other ad hoc papers, as per CFS requests

Output 1.2. HLPE-FSN events and fora and outreach</narrative>
  </description>
